{"ID":"20240220132608-kkceqcy","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132608-kkceqcy","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132608-kkceqcy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171030-7akiyml\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171030-escyogk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171030-escyogk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:210,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:210\u0026#125;","title":"【麻仁丸】（麻子仁丸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171030-7akiyml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-7akiyml","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第二百六十二条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-xm4hhwn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-xm4hhwn","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「趺阳」脉浮而濇，浮则胃气强，濇则小便数，浮濇相搏，大便则难，其脾为约，「麻仁丸」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-i2jtydr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-i2jtydr","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「趺阳」脉，就是脚上冲阳穴的地方。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-ifsunev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-ifsunev","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个跟承气汤不一样。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"承气汤是热而且实。麻仁丸是燥实"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。燥和热不一样。热还有津液，燥的话津液就没有了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-y4tpx55","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-y4tpx55","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻子仁丸方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-bdtqs2l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-bdtqs2l","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻子仁二升。芍药半斤。枳实半斤炙。大黄一斤去皮。厚朴一斤炙去皮。杏仁一斤去皮尖，研作脂。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-ezm92tk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-ezm92tk","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味，为末，炼蜜为丸，桐子大。每服十丸，旦三服，渐加，以和为度。开处方的时候照比例开，麻子仁二，白芍六，枳实六，大黄十二，厚朴十二，杏仁十二。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-tueimxc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-tueimxc","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"遇到"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"病人很虚弱的时候，大黄芒硝下去病人元气受不了，用麻子仁"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。麻子仁有仁剂，仁剂有通便润肠的功能，不像芒硝大黄全部打出去了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-6rexe4d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-6rexe4d","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个为什么叫"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾约麻仁丸，脾主思虑，所以思伤脾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。脾脏管湿，但是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脾喜燥恶湿"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不喜欢湿。当湿完全没有也不行，思念太过的时候会越来越焦躁。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小肠里面的津液来自脾脏，脾在内经主少腹，腹部讲的是小肠"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，小肠水分不够，为什么会不够，就是思，思伤脾，这个是情志引起的。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当脾没法提供津液的时候，小肠会干掉。小肠干掉的时候，出现的症状是大便难，这个症状是脾约"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。你如何知道，你问他大便什么样，像羊大便一样一颗一颗，堵到小肠里面。小肠因为渠道很多，大便堵到弯道的地方，排出来一颗一颗的，而且非常的干。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-gpz5siv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-gpz5siv","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里用丸，不用汤，因为汤太快了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-ds2ebdz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-ds2ebdz","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"比例：麻子仁二。芍药六。枳实六。大黄是十二。厚朴也是十二。杏仁也是十二。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-jednr16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-jednr16","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6——6"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-k9wodaj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-k9wodaj","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如故遇到腹痛的时候，白芍专门治腹痛。麻子仁丸的时候，可以看到病人有腹痛，所以张仲景放了白芍在里面。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-hl4p8nx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-hl4p8nx","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以从张仲景开的处方可以回头看本草的药性，芍药腹痛一定会用到，不管女人月经痛还是阳明证肚子痛，都可以用到芍药。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171030-escyogk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171030-escyogk","updated":"20240312171030"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早上"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"五点到七点是大肠经流注"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的时间，所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"晚上睡前吃麻子仁丸，刚好隔夜第二天早上排出来"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。二十颗就够了，不够酌情再加，三十颗半夜就起来上厕所。小孩子十颗五颗。每个人燥结的程度不一样。如果吃了麻子仁丸，大便通利了，形状会改变。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"正常的时候，一样小便是淡黄清色的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。临床上麻子仁丸用在老年人气血两虚，便秘的时候。如果宿便堵到肛门口了，大便很硬，在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"吃麻仁丸的时候可以用半钱的芒硝，放水里面化掉，用这个水来吞麻仁丸，就可以把这个燥矢打掉"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}